SUMMARY:Food Faith and Fun (Assembly Room)
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exciting opportunity to help create a community-wide time capsule. We’ll bring together multiple generations to write\, draw and share our stories and history with generations to come. What we place in the time capsule in Montclair will be opened in 50 years! (How old will you be then?) In addition to the time capsule project\, we’ll share in worship\, games\, and a pizza dinner. Sign up here!
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/food-faith-and-fun-assembly-room-3/
LOCATION:Assembly Room
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Children/Youth,Featured Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Union Congregational Event":MAILTO:contact@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
