SUMMARY:Youth Faith Formation (Sunday School Room)
DESCRIPTION:Middle and High Schoolers: Grab a snack in the Assembly room then join us for faith formation.  This is a time to hang out with other youth to check\, in\, to ask honest questions about faith and life\, explore Scripture\, engage issues of justice\, and try new spiritual practices. \n(We’ll continue meeting every 2nd and 4th Sunday throughout the year.)
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/youth-faith-formation-sunday-school-room/2026-10-11/
LOCATION:Sunday School Room
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Children/Youth,Featured Events
ORGANIZER;CN="UCC Youth Group":MAILTO:lmccullough@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
