SUMMARY:Youth Lock-in (Guild Room and Kitchen)
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for all night fun.  We’ll begin with dinner on Friday and end with breakfast on Saturday morning. The night will be filled with food\, a service project\, games\, worship\, music\, movies\, plenty of fun and a little bit of sleep. Cost $25.  Bring your sleeping bag and pillow.  Sign up by October 12.
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/youth-group-guild-room-and-kitchen-4/
LOCATION:Guild Room and Kitchen\, 176 Cooper Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events,Children/Youth,Featured Events
ORGANIZER;CN="UCC Youth Group":MAILTO:lmccullough@unioncong.org
END:VEVENT
